{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7663411147463608617","title":"数据BP管培生-2027校招","description":"1、根据业务部门/产品线的需求，积极进行需求沟通，输出BI看板、数据报表或数据分析报告；\n2、深入业务场景，理解业务目标与痛点，梳理/优化业务数据指标体系，跨部门对齐口径；\n3、推动数据底座建设，梳理业务系统数据逻辑（如ERP、OMS、CRM等），协同数据入仓；\n4、基于数据监测主动识别问题、机会和风险，对具体问题点进行专题分析，提出有效的建议，并能沟通推动落地；\n5、完成各种情境下的数据整理、分析与利用工作，及时提供数据支持。","requirement":"1、本科及以上学历，商业分析、信息管理与信息系统、数据科学、统计学相关专业；\n2、熟练掌握Excel、SQL，熟悉Python/R；\n3、熟悉Tableau/QuickBI/FineBI等主流BI工具；\n4、逻辑清晰，对数据敏感，具备良好的沟通能力、执行能力和文档撰写能力；\n5、理解数据开发、数据类指标建设的方法论，有过数据类应用系统研发、建设背景的优先；\n6、有数据相关实习经验、硬件行业实习经验者优先。","recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1784277392157,"channel_online_status":1,"job_id":"7663411147463461161","city_list":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"tag_list":[],"storefront_mode":1,"storefront_list":[],"process_type":2},"recommend_job_post_List":[]},"message":"ok","error":null}